  "The server requires exact Project and source-workspace authority.": "伺服器要求精確的專案和來源工作區權限。",
  "The server returned view access without an applicable review command for this actor and state.": "伺服器已提供檢視權限，但此操作人與狀態沒有適用的評審命令。",
  "The server revalidates every exact revision, release snapshot and clean private file before creating the immutable baseline.": "伺服器會在建立不可變基線前重新驗證每個精確修訂版、發布快照和掃描乾淨的私有文件。",
  "The server revalidates the exact published policy version and current eligible project members before binding.": "伺服器會在綁定前重新驗證確切的已發布策略版本與目前符合條件的專案成員。",
  "The server still controls Project membership and every quality command permission.": "伺服器仍控制專案成員資格和每項品質命令權限。",
  "The server will preserve the prior immutable decision and start a new cycle from current frozen inputs.": "伺服器會保留先前的不可變決策，並從目前已凍結的輸入啟動新週期。",
  "The server will re-resolve evidence, blockers, exceptions, reviews, and input versions before creating an immutable decision snapshot.": "伺服器會先重新解析證據、阻斷項、豁免、評審及輸入版本，再建立不可變的決策快照。",
  "The server, not the browser, controls each available Tooling action.": "每個可用模具開發操作均由伺服器控制，而不是由瀏覽器決定。",
  "The server, not the browser, controls each available Trial action.": "伺服器而非瀏覽器控制每個可用的試模動作。",
  "The service could not be reached.": "無法連線至服務。",
