  "The session language and catalog could not be loaded.": "無法載入工作階段語言與目錄。",
  "The snapshot, output, and audit history cannot be replaced or deleted.": "快照、輸出和稽核歷史無法取代或刪除。",
  "The source field was retained as import provenance.": "來源欄位已保留為匯入來源記錄。",
  "The submitted Trial will freeze tooling, product, material, plan, parameter, sample, and defect inputs.": "提交後的試模將凍結模具開發、產品、材料、計畫、參數、樣件和缺陷輸入。",
  "The successor revision, receipt, actor and exact source references are audited atomically.": "後續修訂、收據、操作者和精確來源參照將以不可分割方式稽核。",
  "The supplier is waiting for your decision.": "供應商正在等待您的決策。",
  "The target-round label is planning intent, not a Trial identity.": "目標輪次標籤是計畫意圖，不是試模身分。",
  "The technical summary and audit history were retained immutably.": "技術摘要和稽核歷程已不可變留存。",
  "The Tool Asset execution profile is unavailable.": "模具資產執行設定檔不可用。",
  "The Tooling stability provider is unavailable.": "模具穩定性提供方無法使用。",
  "The transition is auditable. Any later state change requires another policy-authorized server action.": "此轉換可稽核。此後的任何狀態變更都需要另一次策略授權的伺服器操作。",
  "The Trial command is being verified and committed atomically.": "正在驗證試模命令並以不可分割方式提交。",
  "The Trial command was committed with immutable history and audit truth.": "試模命令已連同不可變歷程和稽核事實提交。",
  "The unresolved action result exceeds the maximum of 10,000 rows.": "未解決行動結果超過 10,000 列上限。",
  "The worker result is polled from the exact job resource.": "系統從精確工作資源輪詢工作程序結果。",
  "The worklist query failed. No data was changed. Change a filter or retry.": "工作清單查詢失敗。未變更任何資料。請變更篩選條件或重試。",
  "The write status is unknown because the command result could not be confirmed. Verify the current Gate review state before preparing another command.": "由於無法確認命令結果，寫入狀態未知。準備其他命令前，請核對目前的階段門評審狀態。",
  "Their approved forward-correction, new-revision, reconciliation, or support path remains visible in the owning workflow.": "其已核准的前向修正、新修訂版、對帳或支援路徑在所屬工作流程中保持可見。",
  "These formal projections are explicit holds. This workspace performs no ERP or external network call.": "這些正式投影是明確的保留項目；此工作區不會呼叫企業資源規劃系統或外部網路。",
  "This action applies only to EBOM revision {{revision}} with {{lines}} immutable lines.": "此操作僅適用於包含 {{lines}} 個不可變列的 EBOM 修訂版 {{revision}}。",
  "This attachment field is read only.": "此附件欄位為唯讀。",
  "This blocks G5 and you own the corrective action.": "此項阻斷 G5，且您負責矯正措施。",
  "This command cannot approve Tooling, dispatch a request, contact ERPNext or create a formal Asset.": "此命令不能核准模具、分發請求、聯絡 ERPNext 或建立正式資產。",
  "This event proves an exact Gate input snapshot hash change. It does not claim which source-object fields changed.": "此事件證明確切的階段門輸入快照雜湊已變更，但不宣稱哪些來源物件欄位已變更。",
  "This feedback is proposed only. It does not change or publish a Project Template.": "此回饋僅為提議內容，不會變更或發佈專案模板。",
  "This field is read only and has no registered attachment.": "此欄位為唯讀，且沒有已登錄附件。",
  "This file is selected locally and has not been uploaded.": "此檔案僅在本機選取，尚未上傳。",
  "This formal Asset projection is read only and owned by ERPNext.": "此正式資產投影為唯讀並由 ERPNext 主責。",
  "This formal quality reference is read only in the current Project context.": "此正式品質引用在目前專案上下文中為唯讀。",
  "This Gate has no active review cycle and your current server permissions do not allow one to be started.": "此階段門沒有作用中的評審週期，且您目前的伺服器權限不允許啟動週期。",
  "This immutable technical package does not close G7 or change Project, Work Item, Tooling, Gate, or ERP truth.": "此不可變技術包不會關閉 G7，也不會變更專案、工作項目、模具開發、階段門或企業資源規劃系統事實。",
  "This inspector binds one exact released EBOM topology to current Item readiness, MBOM expectations, and aggregate plus per-assembly execution truth.": "此檢查器將一個精確的已發佈EBOM拓撲繫結至目前物料就緒狀態、MBOM預期以及彙總與逐裝配節點執行實況。",
  "This is an NPI-owned technical summary. It is not approval, signature, production acceptance, Gate truth or external publication.": "這是由 NPI 主責的技術摘要。它不代表核准、簽署、生產驗收、階段門事實或外部發佈。",
  "This item has no server-offered Work Item source selection.": "此項目沒有伺服器提供的工作項目來源選項。",
  "This object is read only because the released version is immutable.": "此物件為唯讀，因為已發布版本不可變。",
  "This operation is observe-only. Correction or new owning commands remain outside this workspace.": "此操作僅供檢視。更正命令或新的主責命令不屬於此工作區。",
  "This outcome does not require an exception.": "此結果不需要豁免。",
  "This package has expired. Create a new package to download current exact bytes.": "此物件包已過期。請建立新物件包以下載目前精確位元組。",
  "This planned Round has no locked input revision.": "此已規劃輪次沒有鎖定輸入版本。",
  "This Project": "本專案",
  "This Project keeps its previously bound work policy version.": "此專案保留已綁定的工作策略版本。",
  "This prototype does not persist an audit record. A submitted navigation decision would record the actor and outcome without field content.": "此原型不會持久儲存稽核記錄。提交後的導覽決策會記錄操作人與結果，但不記錄欄位內容。",
  "This prototype refresh restores the simulated processing state; no durable remote operation is queried.": "此原型重新整理會恢復模擬的處理中狀態；不會查詢持久化遠端操作。",
  "This records reconciliation intent only. It does not assert target success, change a formal identity, or redispatch the operation.": "這僅記錄對帳意圖。它不會斷言目標成功、變更正式識別或重新分派操作。",
  "This request reached a final failure. Correct the source data and prepare a new execution request.": "此請求已進入最終失敗。請更正來源資料並準備新的執行請求。",
  "This review records an NPI One proposal only. It does not create ERP quality, customer signature, Gate, readiness or Tooling lifecycle truth.": "此審查僅記錄 NPI One 提案，不會建立企業資源規劃系統品質、客戶簽署、階段門、就緒度或模具生命週期事實。",
  "This review surface sends no production request and changes no saved settings.": "此審查介面不會傳送正式環境請求，也不會變更任何已儲存設定。",
  "This screen kept its previous language and catalog. Retry to reconcile with the session, or share the reference ID with support.": "此頁面保留先前的語言與目錄。請重試以核對工作階段狀態，或將參考編號提供給支援人員。",
  "This supplier-responsible milestone is still reported by an internal NPI user.": "此供應商負責的里程碑仍由內部 NPI 使用者回報。",
